      "mergeID": "6160dd802322c551c099bcfc",
      "mergedPostDetails": "The new quick menu could benefit greatly from the ability to adjust it's offset and size for various reasons.\nAs for smoothing ~\nCurrently the new UI has mouse smoothing that works great as long as the hand holding the UI isn't also shaking. If it'd be possible to smooth the position and or rotation of the quick menu that'd be amazing.\nAttached to this tweet is a video example of the struggle tremors can cause with the UI.\nhttps://twitter.com/zenithval/status/1446620936179003394\nCurrently, I hold the controller against my hip to stop the tremors but looking straight down at that angle can be irritating.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1137] Quick menu Offset, Size, & Smoothing options",
      "pinned": false,
      "postID": "6160d315198ffa76f3803e8f",
      "private": false,
      "spam": false,
      "synthetic": true,
      "value": ""
